Vector Search = Meaning Match
                ✅ Similar Meaning Search

RAG          = Vector Search + Generate
                ✅ Basic Document Chatbot

Self-RAG     = Vector Search + Generate + Self Check
                ✅ High Accuracy Systems

CRAG         = Vector Search + Context Check + Generate
                ✅ Verify Retrieved Context

Fusion RAG   = Multiple Queries + Multiple Vector Searches
             + Fusion/Merge
             + Reranker
             + Generate
                ✅ Complex Multi-Step Questions

Hybrid RAG   = BM25 (Keyword Search) + Vector Search (Meaning Match)
             + Reranker
             + Generate
                ✅ Enterprise Search / Code Search
